# Forming the Harzburg Front

The Marxist threat is still entrenched in the Reichstag and the factories. The SPD's democratic coalition and the KPD's red street fighters threaten to plunge Germany into Bolshevik chaos.

Many in our party, especially Röhm's SA, are demanding total mobilization to sweep the left off the streets. Traditional conservatives in the DNVP are also getting anxious. We need a unified national front to crush the Republic.

- @ignore_them: The Marxist moment will fade. Focus on internal organization.
- @street_violence: Order the SA to escalate street clashes with the KPD.
- @harzburg_front

@ignore_them
on-arrival: sa_faction_dissent += 10; strasser_dissent += 5

We choose not to focus on a unified anti-Marxist campaign right now. This decision deeply frustrates the SA, who are itching for street violence, and annoys the Strasserites who want active conflict.

@street_violence
title: Unleash the SA on the red strongholds.
on-arrival: sa_militancy += 0.2; public_panic += 5; sa_faction_dissent -= 5; reichswehr_loyalty -= 5

The SA marches directly into working-class neighborhoods. Brutal street fights break out against the communist RFB and democratic Reichsbanner. The public panic rises, but the regular Army (Reichswehr) is disgusted by our lawlessness.

@harzburg_front
title: Form the Harzburg Front!
subtitle: Rally the NSDAP, DNVP, and Stahlhelm into a united right-wing vanguard.
choose-if: nsdap_votes >= 15 and dnvp_relation >= 40 and harzburg_front_formed == 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if dnvp_relation < 40 : The DNVP despises us too much to negotiate. Improve relations first! ?][? if nsdap_votes < 15 : Our party isn't influential enough yet. ?]
on-arrival: harzburg_front_formed = 1; nationalism += 5; nsdap_votes += 4 * (1 - dissent); dnvp_relation += 15; sa_faction_dissent -= 10;

We establish a unified coalition at Bad Harzburg! The NSDAP, Alfred Hugenberg’s nationalist DNVP, and the massive Stahlhelm veterans' league stand side-by-side. We demand the immediate resignation of the democratic government.

What is the core pillar of our unified front?

- @anti_marxism: The total eradication of Marxism and Bolshevism in Germany.
- @anti_weimar: The destruction of the decadent Weimar system.
- @rearmament: Total military rearmament and tearing up the Treaty of Versailles.
- @all_front: All of the above.

@anti_marxism
go-to: hf_end

@anti_weimar
go-to: hf_end

@rearmament
go-to: hf_end

@all_front
go-to: hf_end

@hf_end

The Harzburg Front has energized the nationalist right and legitimized our party in the eyes of middle-class conservatives.
